27806617", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1468113317689105", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393901_1468113321022438_5301992700359513093_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YyRiDFAU5DoQ7kNvwH2yDsR&_nc_oc=AdnkUf5QkoC-HYosO6bBIMERqI8kad_ir5DFMYzkcjebagIQF3ZTNHNj9D6-xawdhL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy0lQbOz8ewVTKZu485-nr8LdOu5OE5O-IAhy9kVMhS3Q&oe=69BA8E46"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1183010303571395", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393491_1183010306904728_6851860163469096445_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z3tRHcT0oBEQ7kNvwGvP-tQ&_nc_oc=AdkX982SNjC7YElsgm_10cI9OXk0AWZVeN-jLzmPFG57F-Gvw9Yu5cRn4c9oh8TwObA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy6ZvOE92bJllDAAl2EcXITXEbroPczl3gDghSXT0PGyw&oe=69BA8B23"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1358340778764461", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473402211_1358340782097794_7615245122570796576_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oCa-P_lX1jMQ7kNvwE7VeOB&_nc_oc=Adn6qg7CHIhp8sYJxHm4dMWyyqg9Uw91boGuRWLQuSj2YUvqhtleYxKRMMvOon65yxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw6zSMpQY4ID2WitcAn7daeLRL_EzDBfM24smGij8UZIw&oe=69BAA1EB"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1023722979911327", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824623_1023722983244660_6615002093131769634_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZeFVRQaJIz8Q7kNvwGVZhq7&_nc_oc=Adk-cTDwQXfHsAC13UXMOY9a2xkCbhWZz0ppm4--1tCmjf_UoiuHposbDNf74wEGrN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzPpYCYYPQGXd7xz681PLq835_Ent1owMhafX82HDMJCw&oe=69BAA6D7"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1062837435691242", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392048_1062837442357908_3730609957565045373_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XBJDyqsQx1IQ7kNvwGRT0Jb&_nc_oc=AdkgoOIy19OKW8ACQTxbxxHC2uM4d_yifEvpXlaktyf8J-J6a1qYL-pzsJ0cxnhsOU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyUEdeZK3y0reSoDanT0mMPFh7nFM9D6Z-m8-5Ltv4LSg&oe=69BAB753"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car War Vr: RC Stunt Game", "keywords": ["driving", "race", "mini", "drift", "fight"], "long_description": "Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is an action-packed VR racing and combat game that puts you in control of high-powered remote control cars armed to the teeth. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, this single-player experience combines arcade-style racing, vehicle combat, and extreme stunt driving into one adrenaline-fueled package.\nStrap into the cockpit view of your RC war machine and enter explosive arenas filled with jumps, ramps, and AI enemies. Use skill, speed, and strategy to perform jaw-dropping stunts, avoid deadly traps, and blast opponents with powerful weapons like rockets, lasers, and EMPs.\nCustomize your car with a variety of upgrades\u2014boosters, armor, wheels, and weapons\u2014to suit your combat style. Explore unique environments, from backyard battlegrounds to sci-fi stunt zones, each crafted for fast-paced, chaotic fun.\nKey Features:\nImmersive VR racing combat with intuitive controls\n\n\nHigh-speed, physics-driven RC stunt action\n\n\n- Customizable cars with unlockable weapons and gadgets\n- Challenging single-player missions and smart AI opponents\n- Explosive visuals with slow-motion effects and dynamic crashes\n\nExperience the thrill of car battles in VR like never before. Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is the ultimate test of your reflexes, creativity, and combat driving skills.", "short_description": "Race, drift, and stunt in this high-speed RC car VR experience! Build custom tracks, upgrade your ride, and compete solo in action-packed challenges. Designed for Meta Quest, this immersive racing game brings remote control fun to life with realistic physics and endless creativity."}]},